        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam DefaultTextAlignment center\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor #333333\nskinparam ArrowColor #666666\n\ntitle Struktur Alokasi: Penempatan Perangkat Lunak dan Penugasan Tim\\nLayanan Tugas Akhir (Subsistem Assignment &amp; Assessment)\n\nnode \&quot;Perangkat Pengguna\&quot; #FCE4D6 {\n    [Browser Mahasiswa &amp; Dosen]\n}\n\nnode \&quot;Server Aplikasi (Cloud Kampus UMI)\&quot; #DDEBF7 {\n    [Server Web Tugas Akhir]\n    [Antrean Pesan (Message Queue)]\n    [Worker Service]\n    [Cache Kuota &amp; Jadwal]\n}\n\nnode \&quot;Server Data &amp; Penyimpanan Kampus\&quot; #FFF2CC {\n    [Basis Data Akademik Pusat]\n    [Cloud Object Storage]\n}\n\n&#39; Hubungan jaringan antar lingkungan\n[Browser Mahasiswa &amp; Dosen] --&gt; [Server Web Tugas Akhir] : HTTPS\n[Server Web Tugas Akhir] --&gt; [Basis Data Akademik Pusat] : SQL\n[Worker Service] --&gt; [Cloud Object Storage] : API / SDK\n\npackage \&quot;Penugasan Modul ke Tim (Alokasi Kerja)\&quot; #EBF1F5 {\n    rectangle \&quot;Tim A\\n• Halaman Pengajuan Judul\\n• Form Logbook &amp; Sidang\&quot; as TeamA\n    rectangle \&quot;Tim B\\n• Pengelola Tugas Akhir\\n• Validasi SKS &amp; Kuota\\n• Penjadwalan Sidang\&quot; as TeamB\n    rectangle \&quot;Tim C\\n• Repositori Dokumen Skripsi\\n• Repositori Nilai Akademik\&quot; as TeamC\n    rectangle \&quot;Tim D\\n• Infrastruktur Cloud\\n• Message Queue &amp; Uji Beban\&quot; as TeamD\n}\n\nnote bottom of TeamA\n  &lt;b&gt;Cara Membaca:&lt;/b&gt; Struktur alokasi menjawab dua pertanyaan utama: \n  \&quot;di mana perangkat lunak dijalankan?\&quot; dan \&quot;siapa yang membuat tiap bagian modulnya?\&quot;[cite: 1]\nend note\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="O7Qz1X2gmz2kaRqW8yjr-1">
